# Optional. Everything has a safe default; the lab needs no tenant and no credentials.
# The shared settings file is ~/Development/.env (mode 600; STANDALONE_ENV overrides the path), read by every standalone app.
# This lab reads ONE optional key from it and ignores every other key:
# CONFLAB_PROBE_EXTERNAL=1        # Live probe may reach the one https URL you type (host only; never set in Docker). Default: loopback targets only
# Per-run settings (shell, not the shared file; the shared file holds no PORT):
# CONFLAB_PORT=4901               # must be in 4900-4949
# CONFLAB_HOST=127.0.0.1          # loopback only unless CONFLAB_BIND=1 is set on purpose (the container does)
